{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Lady Masuma (s.a.) of Qom",
  "data": "Enter the Haram\nTo seek permission, stand before the zarih facing the qiblah and recite 34 times:\nاَللَّهُ أَكْبَرُ\nAllah O Akbar\nAllah Is The Great\nRecite 33 times:\nسُبْحَانَ اللَّهِ‏\nSubhaan Allah\nGlory Be To Allah\nRecite 33 times:\nاَلْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ‏\nAlhumdulillah\nPraise Be To Allah\nThen recite the ziyarat:\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَى آدَمَ صِفْوَةِ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَى نُوحٍ نَبِيِّ اللَّهِ‏\nalssalamu `ala adama safwati allahi alssalamu `ala nuhin nabiyyi allahi\nPeace be upon Adam the choice of Allah. Peace be upon Noah the prophet of Allah.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَى إِبْرَاهِيمَ خَلِيلِ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَى مُوسَى كَلِيمِ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَى عِيسَى رُوحِ اللَّهِ‏\nalssalamu `ala ibrahima khalili allahi alssalamu `ala musa kalimi allahi alssalamu `ala `isa ruhi allahi\nPeace be upon Abraham the friend of Allah. Peace be upon Moses the spoken by Allah. Peace be upon Jesus the spirit of Allah.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُولَ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خَيْرَ خَلْقِ اللَّهِ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya rasula allahi alssalamu `alayka ya khayra khalqi allahi\nPeace be upon you, O Allah’s Messenger. Peace be upon you, O Allah’s best creature.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَفِيَّ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ خَاتَمَ النَّبِيِّينَ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya safiyya allahi alssalamu `alayka ya muhammada bna `abdillahi khatama alnnabiyyina\nPeace be upon you, O elite of Allah. Peace be upon you, O Muhammad the son of `Abdullah and the seal of the Prophets.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا أَمِيرَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلِيَّ بْنَ أَبِي طَالِبٍ وَصِيَّ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya amira almu'minina `aliyya bna abi talibin wasiyya rasuli allahi\nPeace be upon you, O Commander of the Faithful `Ali the son of Abu-Talib and the successor of Allah’s Messenger.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا فَاطِمَةُ سَيِّدَةَ نِسَاءِ الْعَالَمِينَ‏\nalssalamu `alayki ya fatimatu sayyidata nisa'i al`alamina\nPeace be upon you, O Fatimah the doyenne of the women of the worlds.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكُمَا يَا سِبْطَيْ نَبِيِّ الرَّحْمَةِ وَسَيِّدَيْ شَبَابِ أَهْلِ الْجَنَّةِ\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَلِيَّ بْنَ الْحُسَيْنِ سَيِّدَ الْعَابِدِينَ وَقُرَّةَ عَيْنِ النَّاظِرِينَ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya `aliyyu bna alhusayni sayyida al`abidina wa qurrata `ayni alnnazirina\nPeace be upon you, O `Ali the son of al-Husayn, the chief of the worshippers and the delight of the eye of all seers.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ بَاقِرَ الْعِلْمِ بَعْدَ النَّبِيِ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya muhammadu bna `aliyyin baqira al`ilmi ba`da alnnabiyyi\nPeace be upon you, O Muhammad the son of `Ali, the splitter of knowledge after the Prophet.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا جَعْفَرَ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ الصَّادِقَ الْبَارَّ الْأَمِينَ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya ja`faru bna muhammadin alssadiqu albarru al-aminu\nPeace be upon you, O Ja`far the son of Muhammad, the veracious, dutiful, and honest.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُوسَى بْنَ جَعْفَرٍ الطَّاهِرَ الطُّهْرَ\nalssalamu `alayka ya musa bna ja`farin alttahiru alttuhru\nPeace be upon you, O Musa the son of Ja`far, the immaculate and ever-pure.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَلِيَّ بْنَ مُوسَى الرِّضَا الْمُرْتَضَى‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya `aliyyu bna musa alrrida almurtada\nPeace be upon you, O `Ali the son of Musa, the well-pleased and well-contented.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مُحَمَّدَ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ التَّقِيَّ السَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَلِيَّ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ النَّقِيَّ النَّاصِحَ الْأَمِينَ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya muhammadu bna `aliyyin alttaqiyyu alssalamu `alayka ya `aliyyu bna muhammadin alnnaqiyyu alnnasihu al-aminu\nPeace be upon you, O Muhammad the son of `Ali, the pious. Peace be upon you, O `Ali the son of Muhammad, the immaculate, sincere, and honest.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَسَنَ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ السَّلاَمُ عَلَى الْوَصِيِّ مِنْ بَعْدِهِ‏\nalssalamu `alayka ya hasanu bna `aliyyin alssalamu `ala alwasiyyi min ba`dihi\nPeace be upon you, O Hasan the son of `Ali. Peace be upon the next successor.\nاللَّهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَى نُورِكَ وَسِرَاجِكَ وَوَلِيِّ وَلِيِّكَ وَوَصِيِّ وَصِيِّكَ وَحُجَّتِكَ عَلَى خَلْقِكَ‏\nallahumma salli `ala nurika wa sirajika wa waliyyi waliyyika wa wasiyyi wasiyyika wa hujjatika `ala khalqika\nO Allah, send blessings upon Your light, Your lantern, the representative of Your representative, the successor of Your successor, and the argument of You against Your creatures.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا بِنْتَ رَسُولِ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا بِنْتَ فَاطِمَةَ وَخَدِيجَةَ\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta rasuli allahi alssalamu `alayki ya binta fatimata wa khadijata\nPeace be upon you, O daughter of Allah’s Messenger. Peace be upon you, O daughter of Fatimah and Khadijah.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا بِنْتَ أَمِيرِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ السَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا بِنْتَ الْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَيْنِ‏\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta amiri almu'minina alssalamu `alayki ya binta alhasani walhusayni\nPeace be upon you, O daughter of the Commander of the Faithful. Peace be upon you, O daughter of al-Hasan and al-Husayn.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا بِنْتَ وَلِيِّ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا أُخْتَ وَلِيِّ اللَّهِ السَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا عَمَّةَ وَلِيِّ اللَّهِ‏\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta waliyyi allahi alssalamu `alayki ya ukhta waliyyi allahi alssalamu `alayki ya `ammata waliyyi allahi\nPeace be upon you, O daughter of Allah’s representative. Peace be upon you, O sister of Allah’s representative. Peace be upon you, O paternal aunt of Allah’s representative.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ يَا بِنْتَ مُوسَى بْنِ جَعْفَرٍ وَرَحْمَةُ اللَّهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهُ‏\nalssalamu `alayki ya binta musa bni ja`farin wa rahmatu allahi wa barakatuhu\nPeace be upon you, O daughter of Musa the son of Ja`far. Allah’s mercy and blessings, too, be upon you.\nالسَّلاَمُ عَلَيْكِ عَرَّفَ اللَّهُ بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَكُمْ فِي الْجَنَّةِ\nalssalamu `alayki `arrafa allahu baynana wa baynakum fi aljannati\nPeace be upon you. May Allah introduce us to you all in Paradise,\nوَحَشَرَنَا فِي زُمْرَتِكُمْ وَأَوْرَدَنَا حَوْضَ نَبِيِّكُمْ وَسَقَانَا بِكَأْسِ جَدِّكُمْ مِنْ يَدِ عَلِيِّ بْنِ أَبِي طَالِبٍ‏\nwa hasharana fi zumratikum wa awradana hawda nabiyyikum wa saqana bika'si jaddikum min yadi `aliyyi bni abi talibin\ninclude us with your group, allow us to approach the pond of Your Prophet, and serve us with water from the cup of your grandfather and from the hand of `Ali the son of Abu-Talib.\nصَلَوَاتُ اللَّهِ عَلَيْكُمْ أَسْأَلُ اللَّهَ أَنْ يُرِيَنَا فِيكُمُ السُّرُورَ وَالْفَرَجَ‏\nsalawatu allahi `alaykum as'alu allaha an yuriyana fikumu alssurura walfaraja\nAllah’s blessings be upon you all. I beseech Allah to show us delight and relief through you,\nوَأَنْ يَجْمَعَنَا وَإِيَّاكُمْ فِي زُمْرَةِ جَدِّكُمْ مُحَمَّدٍ صَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَآلِهِ‏\nwa an yajma`ana wa iyyakum fi zumrati jaddikum muhammadin salla allahu `alayhi wa alihi\nto join us with you in the group of your grandfather Muhammad, Allah’s blessings be upon him and his Household,\nوَأَنْ لاَ يَسْلُبَنَا مَعْرِفَتَكُمْ إِنَّهُ وَلِيٌّ قَدِيرٌ\nwa an la yaslubana ma`rifatakum innahu waliyyun qadirun\nand never to deprive us of our recognition of you. Verily, He is Guardian and All-powerful.\nأَتَقَرَّبُ إِلَى اللَّهِ بِحُبِّكُمْ وَالْبَرَاءَةِ مِنْ أَعْدَائِكُمْ وَالتَّسْلِيمِ إِلَى اللَّهِ رَاضِياً بِهِ غَيْرَ مُنْكِرٍ وَلاَ مُسْتَكْبِرٍ\nataqarrabu ila allahi bihubbikum walbara'ati min a`da'ikum walttaslimi ila allahi radiyan bihi ghayra munkirin wa la mustakbirin\nI seek nearness to Allah through my love for you, repudiation of your enemies, and submission to Allah, accepting Him without denial or arrogance,\nوَعَلَى يَقِينِ مَا أَتَى بِهِ مُحَمَّدٌ وَبِهِ رَاضٍ نَطْلُبُ بِذَلِكَ وَجْهَكَ يَا سَيِّدِي اللَّهُمَّ وَرِضَاكَ وَالدَّارَ الْآخِرَةَ\nwa `ala yaqini ma ata bihi muhammadun wa bihi radin natlubu bidhalika wajhaka ya sayyidi allahumma wa ridaka walddara al-akhirata\nbeing fully certain of what Muhammad has brought, and showing full satisfaction with it. We, through this, only seek Your Face, O my Master Allah, and Your satisfaction as well as the Next Abode.\nيَا فَاطِمَةُ اشْفَعِي لِي فِي الْجَنَّةِ فَإِنَّ لَكِ عِنْدَ اللَّهِ شَأْناً مِنَ الشَّأْنِ‏\nya fatimatu ishfa`i li fi aljannati fa'inna laki `inda allahi sha'nan min alshsha'ni\nO Fatimah, (please) intercede for me to win Paradise, for you enjoy an outstanding status with Allah.\nاللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ أَنْ تَخْتِمَ لِي بِالسَّعَادَةِ فَلاَ تَسْلُبْ مِنِّي مَا أَنَا فِيهِ‏\nallahumma inni as'aluka an takhtima li bilssa`adati fala taslub minni ma ana fihi\nO Allah, I do beseech You to seal my life with happiness; so, (please) do not deprive me of that which I enjoy.\nوَلاَ حَوْلَ وَلاَ قُوَّةَ إِلاَّ بِاللَّهِ الْعَلِيِّ الْعَظِيمِ‏\nwa la hawla wa la quwwata illa billahi al`aliyyi al`azimi\nThere is neither might nor power except with Allah the All-high and All-great.\nاللَّهُمَّ اسْتَجِبْ لَنَا وَتَقَبَّلْهُ بِكَرَمِكَ وَعِزَّتِكَ وَبِرَحْمَتِكَ وَعَافِيَتِكَ‏\nallahumma istajib lana wa taqabbalhu bikaramika wa `izzatika wa birahmatika wa `afiyatika\nO Allah, (please) respond to us and accept this from us in the name of Your generosity, almightiness, mercy, and bestowal of wellbeing.\nوَصَلَّى اللَّهُ عَلَى مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِهِ أَجْمَعِينَ وَسَلَّمَ تَسْلِيماً يَا أَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِين\nwa salla allahu `ala muhammadin wa alihi ajma`ina wa sallama tasliman ya arhama alrrahimina\nMay Allah bless Muhammad and his entire Household and pour down peace on them, O most merciful of all those who show mercy."
}
